\newlabel{fig:geofence_diagram}{{4}{14}{Four-panel geofence protection visualisation. (a)~Three nested boundaries: SSSI no-fly zone, buffer zone, and flight area polygon. (b)~Repulsive force field that deflects the drone away from the SSSI boundary. (c)~Waypoint correction: the commanded waypoint (red) is shifted to a safe position (green) by the repulsive offset. (d)~Emergency mode switch when the drone enters the SSSI zone}{figure.caption.23}{}}
